l":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-a1e17c466c2a4e7806fc"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-a1e17c466c2a4e7806fc","order":4750}],"persons":[{"id":"hechang-p-105fcdba20b4f8","name":"杜安","evidence":["hechang-q-2995fd81955af488a444","hechang-q-4c6172c0bc6052cb74f1","hechang-q-fcabbab57d7aedc6f10e","hechang-q-a1e17c466c2a4e7806fc"],"facts":[],"mentions":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-2995fd81955af488a444","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-2b9f13516e39cc1ccab5","layer":"pei","quote":"《先贤行状》曰：“安年十岁，名称乡党。至十三，入太学，号曰‘神童’。既名知人，清高绝俗。洛阳令周纡，数候安，安常逃避不见。时贵戚慕安高行，多有与书者，辄不发；以虑后患，常凿壁藏书。后诸与书者，果有大罪，推捕所与交通者。吏至门，安乃发壁出书，印封如故，当时皆嘉其虑远。","attribution":"裴注·先贤行状","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5f96384ee27ad7b7aab1","start":3,"end":136},{"id":"hechang-q-4c6172c0bc6052cb74f1","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-2b9f13516e39cc1ccab5","layer":"pei","quote":"三府并辟，公车特征，拜宛令。先是，宛有报仇者，其令不忍致理，将与俱亡。县中豪强有告其处者，致捕得。安深疾恶之，到官，治戮，肆之于市。惧有司绳弹，遂自免。","attribution":"裴注·先贤行状","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5f96384ee27ad7b7aab1","start":136,"end":212},{"id":"hechang-q-a1e17c466c2a4e7806fc","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-2b9f13516e39cc1ccab5","layer":"pei","quote":"以病卒官。时服薄敛，素器不漆，子自将车。州郡贤之，表章坟墓。","attribution":"裴注·先贤行状","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5f96384ee27ad7b7aab1","start":230,"end":260},{"id":"hechang-q-fcabbab57d7aedc6f10e","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-2b9f13516e39cc1ccab5","layer":"pei","quote":"后征拜巴郡太守，率身正下，以礼化俗。","attribution":"裴注·先贤行状","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5f96384ee27ad7b7aab1","start":212,"end":230}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
